\item OpenAI, \emph{A power saving for planar unit distances}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-power-saving-for-planar-unit-distances-September-23-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex\#L12}{thm:main}.
